{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4789-aaaa-orchestrator0001",
    "name": "Order Orchestrator — Inbazz",
    "description": "Coleção completa do desafio backend pleno (Inbazz). Cobre todos os endpoints com cenários de sucesso, falha e i18n.\n\n**Como usar:**\n\n1. Importe esta coleção no Postman (Import → Files).\n2. A variável de coleção `baseUrl` aponta para `http://localhost:3001` (porta do `.env` local).\n3. Suba a infra: `docker compose up -d postgres redis && npm run start:dev`.\n4. Rode `npm run seed:users` para criar 3 usuários demo (pt-BR, en, es) — copie as 3 API keys impressas no console e cole nas variáveis `apiKeyPtBR`, `apiKeyEN` e `apiKeyES`.\n5. Use os endpoints autenticados — escolha qual variável de chave usar conforme o idioma desejado.\n\n**Estrutura:**\n- Health, Documentação, i18n: públicos.\n- POST /webhooks/orders: público (sistemas externos).\n- POST /users: público (provisionamento).\n- GET /orders, GET /queue/metrics: protegidos por API key (Authorization: Bearer ou X-API-Key).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth & Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /users — pt-BR (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Admin-Key", "value": "{{adminKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo-pt@inbazz.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Demo PT-BR\",\n  \"password\": \"demo-pass-1234\",\n  \"preferredLanguage\": \"PT_BR\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users"] },
            "description": "Cria usuário pt-BR. Requer `X-Admin-Key` (variável `adminKey` da coleção, vinda da env `ADMIN_API_KEY`). Resposta inclui `api_key` em texto puro — somente aqui."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /users — en (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Admin-Key", "value": "{{adminKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo-en@inbazz.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Demo EN\",\n  \"password\": \"demo-pass-1234\",\n  \"preferredLanguage\": \"EN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /users — es (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Admin-Key", "value": "{{adminKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo-es@inbazz.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Demo ES\",\n  \"password\": \"demo-pass-1234\",\n  \"preferredLanguage\": \"ES\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /users — sem admin key (401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"sem-auth@inbazz.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Sem Auth\",\n  \"password\": \"demo-pass-1234\",\n  \"preferredLanguage\": \"PT_BR\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users"] },
            "description": "Esperado: 401 — POST /users requer admin key."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /users — email duplicado (409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Admin-Key", "value": "{{adminKey}}" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "pt-BR" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo-pt@inbazz.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Outro\",\n  \"password\": \"demo-pass-1234\",\n  \"preferredLanguage\": \"PT_BR\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users"] },
            "description": "Esperado: 409 com mensagem traduzida em pt-BR."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/login — rotaciona API key (perdeu a chave?)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo-pt@inbazz.com\",\n  \"password\": \"demo-pass-1234\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Autentica com email + senha (bcrypt) e gera uma **nova API key**, invalidando a anterior. A resposta traz `api_key` em texto puro — copie e cole na variável da coleção (`apiKeyPtBR`/`apiKeyEN`/`apiKeyES`)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/login — credenciais inválidas (401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "pt-BR" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo-pt@inbazz.com\",\n  \"password\": \"senha-errada\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Esperado: 401 com mensagem genérica em pt-BR ('Email ou senha inválidos' — não diferencia email errado de senha errada por segurança)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhooks (público)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /webhooks/orders — válido",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.variables.set('orderId', 'ext-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$randomUUID}}').slice(0, 8));",
                  "pm.variables.set('idemKey', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"order_id\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"customer\": { \"email\": \"user@example.com\", \"name\": \"Ana Silva\" },\n  \"items\": [{ \"sku\": \"ABC123\", \"qty\": 2, \"unit_price\": 59.90 }],\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"idempotency_key\": \"{{idemKey}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhooks", "orders"]
            },
            "description": "Recebe pedido válido. Esperado: `202 Accepted`. O enriquecimento (USD→BRL via AwesomeAPI) acontece em background."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /webhooks/orders — replay",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": ["pm.variables.set('idemKey', 'demo-replay-fixed-key');"],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"order_id\": \"ext-replay-demo\",\n  \"customer\": { \"email\": \"user@example.com\", \"name\": \"Ana Silva\" },\n  \"items\": [{ \"sku\": \"ABC123\", \"qty\": 2, \"unit_price\": 59.90 }],\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"idempotency_key\": \"{{idemKey}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhooks", "orders"]
            },
            "description": "Envie duas vezes seguidas. A segunda devolve byte-a-byte a mesma resposta da primeira (replay) sem criar pedido duplicado."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /webhooks/orders — hash divergente (422)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"order_id\": \"ext-replay-demo\",\n  \"customer\": { \"email\": \"OUTRO@example.com\", \"name\": \"Outro\" },\n  \"items\": [{ \"sku\": \"ABC123\", \"qty\": 2, \"unit_price\": 59.90 }],\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"idempotency_key\": \"demo-replay-fixed-key\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhooks", "orders"]
            },
            "description": "Reusa a mesma chave do replay com payload diferente. Esperado: 422."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /webhooks/orders — moeda inválida (vai pra DLQ)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.variables.set('orderId', 'ext-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$randomUUID}}').slice(0, 8));",
                  "pm.variables.set('idemKey', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"order_id\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"customer\": { \"email\": \"u@e.com\", \"name\": \"Demo\" },\n  \"items\": [{ \"sku\": \"X\", \"qty\": 1, \"unit_price\": 10 }],\n  \"currency\": \"AFN\",\n  \"idempotency_key\": \"{{idemKey}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhooks", "orders"]
            },
            "description": "AFN (Afghan afghani) é um código ISO 4217 válido (passa na validação do DTO), mas a AwesomeAPI não tem o par AFN-BRL. Webhook aceita (202), o worker tenta enriquecer, recebe 4xx do provedor → falha imediata sem retry → status `FAILED_ENRICHMENT` + job na DLQ."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /webhooks/orders — payload inválido em pt-BR",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "pt-BR" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"order_id\": \"ext-invalid-pt\",\n  \"customer\": { \"email\": \"not-an-email\", \"name\": \"Ana\" },\n  \"items\": [{ \"sku\": \"X\", \"qty\": 1, \"unit_price\": 9.999 }],\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"idempotency_key\": \"any-key\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhooks", "orders"]
            },
            "description": "Esperado: 400 com lista de erros traduzida em português."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orders (autenticado)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /orders — listar (user pt-BR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKeyPtBR}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["orders"],
              "query": []
            },
            "description": "Lista pedidos. Mensagens de erro retornadas no idioma pt-BR (preferência do usuário autenticado)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /orders — listar (user en)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKeyEN}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /orders — listar (user es)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKeyES}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /orders — filtro por status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKeyEN}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders?status=ENRICHED&page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["orders"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "status", "value": "ENRICHED" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /orders/:id — pedido inexistente (404 traduzido pt-BR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKeyPtBR}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"]
            },
            "description": "Esperado: 404 com `Pedido com id ... não encontrado` (idioma resolvido pelo `preferredLanguage` do usuário autenticado)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /orders sem auth → 401",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["orders"] },
            "description": "Esperado: 401 — Chave de API obrigatória (mensagem em inglês por default; envie Accept-Language para outro idioma)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Queue & Admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /queue/metrics",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKeyEN}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/queue/metrics",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["queue", "metrics"]
            },
            "description": "Métricas agregadas das filas `enrichment-queue` e `enrichment-dlq` (waiting/active/completed/failed/delayed)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /admin/queues (Bull Board UI — admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Admin-Key", "value": "{{adminKey}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/queues",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "queues"]
            },
            "description": "UI interativa do Bull Board. Requer `X-Admin-Key`. Para acessar via navegador (que não envia headers facilmente), use uma extensão como ModHeader ou abra com `curl -H 'X-Admin-Key: <chave>' -L http://localhost:3001/admin/queues`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /admin/queues — sem admin key (401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/queues",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "queues"]
            },
            "description": "Esperado: 401 — Bull Board exige admin key."
          }
        }
      ]
